      "description": "Sustained (5-min) inference pressure, split PRODUCTIVE vs STALLED. Productive = every active worker blocked on inference AND generating tokens over the trailing 300s (compute-bound). Stalled = the low-throughput subset (429 / network / TTFT / queueing => rate-limit bound). Main = the dispatcher; Fleet excludes the main loop. productive = full − stalled, clamped at 0."
